{"title":"Smart Watches Under 6000","description":"","products":[{"product_id":"terra-fit-smart-watch","title":"Terra Fit Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"599\"\u003eThe Terra Fit Smartwatch is designed for active lifestyles that demand reliability, smart connectivity, and everyday comfort. With Bluetooth calling support, health tracking essentials, and a durable sporty build, Terra Fit helps you stay connected, track your fitness, and manage daily tasks effortlessly—whether you’re working out, commuting, or unwinding.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"899\"\u003eBuilt around a practical full-touch display and powered by a single-chip Bluetooth calling system, Terra Fit delivers smooth performance with essential smart features that matter most. Its long battery life, water resistance, and fitness-focused tools make it a dependable companion for daily wear.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Rose Pink","offer_id":51181307920662,"sku":"22850","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":44679171735830,"sku":"18564","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver Grey","offer_id":44679171768598,"sku":"18577","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red Berry","offer_id":44679171703062,"sku":"18576","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":44679171834134,"sku":"18575","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Olive Green","offer_id":44679171801366,"sku":"18578","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/1_df601d00-3118-441f-ac86-ce5b8f69a31a.webp?v=1776933536"},{"product_id":"ignite-smart-watch","title":"Ignite Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eIgnite your style with Ignite Smart Watch: Boasting a 1.83\" TFT Display, 100+ Watch Faces \u0026amp; a unique Duo Colored Crown. Redefine your look with every touch!!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eIgnite Smart Watch Description!\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Ignite \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmart Watch\u003c\/a\u003e, available at ZeroLifestyle, combines cutting-edge technology with sleek design. Ideal for fitness enthusiasts and tech-savvy individuals, this smartwatch offers an array of features to keep you connected, healthy, and stylish.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Ignite Smart Watch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Ignite Smart Watch features a vibrant full-color touch display, ensuring clear visibility in any lighting.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith continuous heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and fitness tracking, you can stay on top of your health goals.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe watch also includes a step counter and calorie tracker. Smart notifications allow you to receive calls, texts, and social media alerts directly on your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Ignite Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: Full-color touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHealth Tracking: Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eActivity Tracking: Steps, calories, various exercise modes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Multi-day battery life on a single charge\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCustomization: Multiple watch faces\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Ignite Smart Watch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Ignite Smart Watch offers comprehensive tracking features to provide valuable insights into your daily activities and sleep patterns, helping you make informed health decisions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts ability to receive notifications directly on your wrist ensures you stay connected effortlessly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith its sleek design and customizable watch faces, the Ignite Smart Watch is a versatile accessory for any occasion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":46752558317846,"sku":"19611","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":47069377462550,"sku":"19616","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey","offer_id":47069377495318,"sku":"19615","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":46752557957398,"sku":"19612","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Green Gold","offer_id":46752558252310,"sku":"19613","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red","offer_id":46752558285078,"sku":"19614","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/ignite_black-1.webp?v=1773924771"},{"product_id":"luna-smart-watch","title":"Luna Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eSwitch towards infinite possibilities with the Luna Smartwatch, styled through a cosmic full metal body with a 1.39” HD Display and IP67 Water Resistance. With a fully functioning AI Assistant, Luna keeps you connected at every moment. Strap into the future of smartwatches with Active Weather Forecasting, BT Calling, and sleek strap designs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Luna:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1.39” HD Display\u003cbr\u003eIP67 Water Resistance\u003cbr\u003eActive Weather Forecasting\u003cbr\u003eBT Calling\u003cbr\u003eSmart Notifications\u003cbr\u003eActive Health Suites\u003cbr\u003eWorkout Modes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Luna:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay\u003c\/strong\u003e: Full-color touch screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e: Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eActivity Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e: Steps, calories, various exercise modes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e: Long-lasting, multi-day battery life on a single charge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization\u003c\/strong\u003e: Multiple customizable watch faces\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003esmartwatches\u003c\/a\u003e and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":47069797450006,"sku":"20081","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gray","offer_id":47069797548310,"sku":"20080","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":47069797515542,"sku":"20084","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pink Gold","offer_id":47069797482774,"sku":"20077","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":48148570308886,"sku":"20680","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Sporty Gray Rings","offer_id":48926634311958,"sku":"22477","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Sporty Red Rings","offer_id":48926630936854,"sku":"22479","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Luna-_5_3.webp?v=1776510284"},{"product_id":"edge-smartwatch","title":"Edge Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eThe Edge Smartwatch\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStylish and Durable Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Lightweight construction (22g) with a sturdy PC+ABS finish.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVivid TFT Display:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.83-inch screen with a resolution of 240×284 pixels.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLong-Lasting Battery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 7–9 days of regular use and up to 35 days on standby. Quick charging in under 2.5 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eHealth and Fitness Tracking\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Level Measurement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathe Training\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStress Management Tools\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalories Burned Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eStay Connected\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManage calls, messages, and notifications directly from your wrist.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCamera Control for snapping moments.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\"Find Phone\" feature for convenience.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eEveryday Tools\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAlarms, weather updates, flashlight, calculator, and motion gesture for screen activation.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSedentary, drink water, and hand wash reminders.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.83-inch TFT screen with 240×284 resolution.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 7–9 days regular use, 35 days on standby.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Less than 2.5 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP68 rating for durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOperating System:\u003c\/strong\u003e Compatible with Android 9+ and iOS 12+.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.3 with 10-meter transmission range.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Edge Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Edge \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003edelivers a harmonious blend of functionality and style. With advanced health tracking, seamless connectivity, and practical everyday tools, it fits right into your lifestyle. Whether you're working, exercising, or relaxing, the Edge Smartwatch enhances every moment with its innovative features and long-lasting performance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":49894865142038,"sku":"22878","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":49894865174806,"sku":"22879","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gray","offer_id":49894865109270,"sku":"22943","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Rose Pink","offer_id":49894865240342,"sku":"22945","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red Berry","offer_id":49894865207574,"sku":"22944","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/B1_218495a9-8f36-4abf-b51a-64671c0db56e.webp?v=1767865748"},{"product_id":"qube-smartwatch","title":"Qube Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"489\"\u003eStay connected, active, and in control with the \u003cstrong data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"269\"\u003eQube Smartwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e, designed to blend smart technology with everyday convenience. Featuring a vibrant full-touch display and a sleek, modern design, Qube keeps your notifications, fitness tracking, and health insights right on your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"808\"\u003eBuilt for daily performance, the Qube Smartwatch offers comprehensive health monitoring, smart notifications, and multiple sports modes to support your active lifestyle. Whether you're tracking workouts, managing calls, or monitoring your heart rate, Qube delivers reliable performance with long-lasting battery life.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"967\"\u003eWith Bluetooth connectivity, intuitive controls, and a comfortable strap design, Qube is the perfect companion for work, workouts, and everything in between.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Starlight Silver","offer_id":51050937254166,"sku":"23888","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black","offer_id":51050937155862,"sku":"23814","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gray Silver","offer_id":51050937188630,"sku":"23890","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pink Rose","offer_id":51050937221398,"sku":"23889","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/CHAMPAGNE_01.webp?v=1773019308"},{"product_id":"bolt-pro","title":"Bolt Pro Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2 data-end=\"200\" data-start=\"160\"\u003eBolt Pro Smartwatch – Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"104\" data-end=\"348\"\u003eThe ZERO BOLT PRO is a sleek and feature-rich smartwatch designed for everyday fitness, connectivity, and convenience. With its modern square dial and vibrant display, it delivers both style and smart functionality in one powerful wearable.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"366\"\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"1365\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"451\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"451\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"394\"\u003e1.83\" IPS HD Display\u003c\/strong\u003e – Large, bright screen for clear and immersive viewing\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"539\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"539\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"487\"\u003eSingle Chip Bluetooth Calling\u003c\/strong\u003e – Make and receive calls directly from your watch\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"611\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"611\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"562\"\u003e100+ Watch Faces\u003c\/strong\u003e – Personalize your display to match your style\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"685\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"685\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"635\"\u003e100+ Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e – Track a wide range of workouts and activities\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"750\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"750\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"721\"\u003eDynamic Heart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/strong\u003e – Real-time heart tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"804\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"804\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"772\"\u003eSpO₂ Monitoring\u003c\/strong\u003e – Monitor blood oxygen levels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"878\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"878\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"831\"\u003eIP66 Water Resistant\u003c\/strong\u003e – Protection against dust and water splashes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"955\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"955\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"915\"\u003eQibla Direction \u0026amp; Prayer Times\u003c\/strong\u003e – Built-in Islamic lifestyle features\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1007\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1007\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"976\"\u003eTasbih Counter\u003c\/strong\u003e – Convenient digital counter\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1075\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1075\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1033\"\u003eSmart Notifications\u003c\/strong\u003e – Receive call, message, and app alerts\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1129\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1129\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1095\"\u003eSync Contacts\u003c\/strong\u003e – Easy access to saved contacts\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1182\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1182\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1159\"\u003eVoice Assistant Support\u003c\/strong\u003e – Hands-free control\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1231\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1231\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1203\"\u003eBuilt-in Games\u003c\/strong\u003e – On-the-go entertainment\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1289\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1289\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1262\"\u003eAlarm, Timer \u0026amp; Stopwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e – Everyday utility tools\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1365\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1365\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1321\"\u003eUp to 5 Days Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e – Reliable performance on a single charge\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1389\"\u003eAdditional Details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1555\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1417\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1417\"\u003e3D Colorful Dynamic UI\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1439\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1439\"\u003e365 Days Warranty\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1518\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1518\"\u003eCompatible with the ZERO Health app (available on App Store \u0026amp; Google Play)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1555\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1555\"\u003eMagnetic charging cable included\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1734\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eThe ZERO BOLT PRO combines fitness tracking, smart connectivity, and practical lifestyle tools making it ideal for daily wear, workouts, and staying connected anytime, anywhere.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":51061801943318,"sku":"23892","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Vintage brown","offer_id":51068077310230,"sku":"24132","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Graphite Mauve","offer_id":51061801910550,"sku":"24136","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_